        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "/ s. State of Maharashtra 1, wherein the 1 2022 SCC OnLine SC 1383 18.cri.wp.486.2023judgment.odt Hon'ble Apex Court has held that the words \"sufficient ground for proceeding\" appearing in Section 204 of the Code of Criminal Procedure are o"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "56a77c3d52fb4943b0be592e493f4c87_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is these words which amply suggest that an opinion is to be formed only after due application of mind that there is sufficient basis for proceeding against the said accused and the formation of such an opinion is to be stated in the orde"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9d71c87f3218425a91210f4bf07e869e_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is held that if the order is passed mechanically, then such an order cannot be sustained."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ec2cdf8917a94c428008cafd1e2eda06_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Apex Court has held that the Court may not be required to record the detailed reasons, but the reasons recorded must be sufficient to indicate the application of mind by the Court before passing the order.\n7"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "863505301daf4af6a351dd2b6c953956_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "On perusal of the order passed by the learned Magistrate I am fully satisfied that the learned Magistrate has failed to exercise his power in a proper manner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "18f9a73722254f63849985069f438df8_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Learned Magistrate mechanically passed the order of issuance of 18.cri.wp.486.2023judgment.odt summons."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c46c37c75343429cabb9b346dd9ce22b_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Learned Magistrate has not recorded his reasons for passing the order of issuance of summons."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "22f0be3606324095821d569f9a505aeb_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Learned Magistrate was required to record brief reasons as to how he was prima facie satisfied about the disclosure of the offence on the basis of the facts stated in the complaint."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "028b490d552d408983b084957f372eb9_46",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The order passed by the learned Magistrate indicates that before passing the order a proper inquiry was not made."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "87804198ed2c4b0cb58899820abb2363_47",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The order, in my opinion, reflects the casual approach of the Magistrate."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fc621d825f7d4122a57e009bf59a0955_48",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It was passed mechanically."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2ea6f6c373c8440aad603e58d358341c_49",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
            "matched_text": "set aside",
            "start": 52,
            "end": 61
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, in my view, this order is required to be set aside."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0b8ca9a18c544aea8390b7bd107aca01_50",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n8 The next important question is with regard to the course to be adopted after setting aside the said order."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f2492cf5581c4c7ba047c63e9f615d31_51",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There are two options."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2e2ed317f39544e582f71edc9a994c13_52",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "One, to quash the proceedings in entirety or second to grant the Magistrate one opportunity to rectify this patent illegality."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4a54342a295b4f3fa66043a84b5071ac_53",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In my opinion, while choosing one of the options, the Court has to take a holistic view of the matter."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2cc99f8358354efbb368e8199fcb224f_54",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nRam Bharat vs State Of Mah. Thr. M.N. Ratnaparkhi on 1 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/153510493/\n3 18.cri.wp.486.2023judgment.odt"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "184b0f23a144434e84bc464288007802_55",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Perusal of the complaint would show that the necessary facts to establish the basic ingredients of the offence have not been set out."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "225db70286534ad3810076b534a0a37e_56",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The place and address of the residence of the accused has been mentioned in the title of the complaint as Washim."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7b2b5d1b7dfa4eeb9e22f4637cee5d8b_57",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, the address mentioned in Form-1 is of Uttarakhand."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3b385d7c31ba44f9aa328c82f43db0dd_58",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This document was filed with the complaint."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0f7c3f80543a4066bb7c9f65b7d4f663_59",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In view of this, the learned Magistrate ought to have conducted the inquiry as contemplated under Section 202 before issuing the process."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "70b5d06c379d4d4fb628034b86f63b15_60",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It appears that this aspect has also not been dealt with."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5749900522114b6a82249cdb1ca58924_61",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the said accident, two workers lost their lives."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7c96dc71708c4cb8a8f01f0b83dc5ff6_62",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In my view, in such a case, even if it is found that there is some mistake while passing an order, an endeavor must be to do the complete justice by granting an opportunity to rectify such mistake."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a49b0fb7cac74539a9fa845d3375b430_63",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is necessary to state that in this case, a mistake was committed by the learned Magistrate."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "78c088b0723f45738fb5f1d80b54202d_64",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The complainant or any other person could not be held responsible for this mistake."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8e8b1aff753a486ea35f7f62ae1613d3_65",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
            "matched_text": "quashed",
            "start": 138,
            "end": 145
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "In my view, therefore, the complaint, on account of this illegal order passed 18.cri.wp.486.2023judgment.odt by the Magistrate, cannot be quashed outrightly."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "523cef3a51714a5384737f72d2ddd226_66",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
